    <string name="health_permissions_rationale_title">How Octop uses health data</string>
    <string name="health_permissions_rationale_body">With your permission, Octop reads daily steps, sleep sessions, and exercise sessions from Health Connect to help your agent understand routines and prepare more relevant reminders and suggestions. Octop does not write or delete Health Connect data. Collected items are encrypted on this device and remain here until your configured server explicitly accepts them. You can revoke access at any time in Health Connect.</string>

