    <string name="tasks_rec_news_body">Collect important news, changes in your areas of interest, and leads worth tracking.</string>
    <string name="tasks_rec_news_prompt">Use the news connector to prepare today’s news brief. Prioritize developments related to my interests, items that may affect my decisions, and leads worth tracking. Merge duplicate coverage and retain sources. Keep the output concise: what happened, why it matters, and what to watch next.</string>
    <string name="tasks_rec_news_natural">Every morning at 08:00, summarize important news, changes in my areas of interest, and leads worth tracking, with sources</string>
    <string name="tasks_rec_mail_title">Today’s email overview</string>
    <string name="tasks_rec_mail_body">Sort new mail into reply, action, waiting, and for-information groups.</string>
    <string name="tasks_rec_mail_prompt">Use the mail connector to summarize today’s new email. Group messages into reply needed, action needed, waiting, and for information. Keep only the sender, subject, key request, and deadline for each message. Do not send mail on my behalf.</string>
    <string name="tasks_rec_mail_natural">Every morning at 09:00, summarize new email into reply needed, action needed, waiting, and for information</string>
    <string name="tasks_rec_reading_title">Today’s reading review</string>
    <string name="tasks_rec_reading_body">Review today’s key ideas, useful insights, and questions worth exploring further.</string>
    <string name="tasks_rec_reading_prompt">Use the Weixin Reading connector to review what I read today. Extract the most important ideas, insights that may be useful to me, and questions worth exploring further. Keep it concise and do not reproduce long passages.</string>
    <string name="tasks_rec_reading_natural">Every evening at 21:00, review today’s reading and extract key ideas, useful insights, and open questions</string>
    <string name="tasks_rec_calendar_title">Daily meetings and schedule</string>
    <string name="tasks_rec_calendar_body">Organize today’s schedule, preparation, conflicts, and items to confirm in advance.</string>
    <string name="tasks_rec_calendar_prompt">Use the Feishu calendar connector to organize today’s meetings and events in time order. Mark preparation materials, possible conflicts, and anything to confirm in advance. If there are no events, state that clearly.</string>
    <string name="tasks_rec_calendar_natural">Every morning at 07:30, organize today’s meetings and events, including preparation, conflicts, and items to confirm</string>
    <string name="tasks_rec_news_weekly_title">Weekly news threads</string>
    <string name="tasks_rec_news_weekly_body">Connect the week’s important developments, remove repetition, and identify what to watch next.</string>
    <string name="tasks_rec_news_weekly_natural">Every Friday at 18:00, review this week’s important news, connect related developments, and list leads worth tracking next week, with sources</string>
